    "20": {
      "text": "Yeah, right, when Goombas fly.\nAnyway, grousin' won't solve it.<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>I'm gonna stop wastin' time\ndaydreamin' and get to work!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "tokenized_text": "Yeah, right, when Goombas fly.\nAnyway, grousin' won't solve it.<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>I'm gonna stop wastin' time\ndaydreamin' and get to work!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_text": "Yeah, right, when Goombas fly.\nAnyway, grousin' won't solve it.<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>I'm gonna stop wastin' time\ndaydreamin' and get to work!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "Yeah, right, when Goombas fly.\nAnyway, grousin' won't solve it.<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>I'm gonna stop wastin' time\ndaydreamin' and get to work!<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400>",
