    },
    "21": {
      "text": "Ah...<C:0003,0000,0F00> Wait, what?<C:0000,0002,6400>\nI'm back... <C:0003,0000,0F00>I'm alive?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>I thought I would be a\ndesert relic forever...<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "tokenized_text": "Ah...<C:0003,0000,0F00> Wait, what?<C:0000,0002,6400>\nI'm back... <C:0003,0000,0F00>I'm alive?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>I thought I would be a\ndesert relic forever...<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
